        <mxCell id="Y85G3jcZCbOq-ubIuzlO-7" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;orphans: 4; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; line-height: inherit; margin: 0.8em 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; position: relative; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot; class=&quot;md-end-block md-p md-focus&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot; class=&quot;md-plain md-expand&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;1.前端发起请求，请求发送到 INMP 转发中心。&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; line-height: inherit; margin: 0.8em 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; position: relative; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot; class=&quot;md-end-block md-p&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot; class=&quot;md-plain&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;2.调用 client.callClient方法，返回请求结果。&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; line-height: inherit; margin: 0.8em 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; position: relative; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot; class=&quot;md-end-block md-p&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot; class=&quot;md-plain&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;3.触发RestLttsConnImpl的 sendMsg方法，进行请求转发。&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; line-height: inherit; margin: 0.8em 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; position: relative; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot; class=&quot;md-end-block md-p&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot; class=&quot;md-plain&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;4.根据 appId 动态调整请求 URL，构建后端服务的资源路径。&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; line-height: inherit; margin: 0.8em 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; position: relative; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot; class=&quot;md-end-block md-p md-focus&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot; class=&quot;md-plain md-expand&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;5.使用 RestTemplate发起转发请求，完成请求发送。&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
